# Lab 4 reference headers

Updated November 4, 2026.

`definitions.h` defines the reference XBee UART and shared SPI/SD pins.
`sd_functions.h` declares SD initialization, file creation, listing and reading;
the implementation is in `../src/sd_funcitons.cpp` (original spelling retained).

This is the original Lab 4 reference project, not the completed GCS KFS1
file/camera service. Application and vendor sources are preserved. Use
[Lab 8](../../Astro331_Lab8_Code/README.md) for the final firmware, GPIO27/baud
environments, upload/download, camera capture and preview support.
